---
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['expression-visual', { compact }]}>
  <div class="expression-top"><span class="eyebrow">From intention to interpretation</span><span class="small-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↘</span></div>
  <p class="utterance" lang="ko">“조금 줄여줘”</p>
  <p class="translation">“Reduce it a little.”</p>
  <div class="expression-rule" aria-hidden="true"><span></span>↓<span></span></div>
  <div class="axes"><div><span>Adjustment</span><strong>decrease</strong></div><div><span>Magnitude</span><strong>slight</strong></div></div>
  {!compact && <p class="expression-note">Preserving both the direction and the expressed size of a change.</p>}
</div>
